   "body": "**Adversarial review (fable-5.2, mac/M1-r1091-fable, delta 25e1b6b1)**\n\n**APPROVE** — delta `cffb7664..25e1b6b1` is docs only (`docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md`, `MANIFEST.md`); all four findings of round 1 are closed:\n\n1. Skin key follows the session: `W01`, `W01b`, `R830t` named as the user1 pages with the default key; \"98 pages served to a logged-in user1 session\" matches my grep of the corpus (user1: 98 × `666666/404550`, 3 × `FFFFFF/DEDFDF`, 1 404 without a link; anon 46 and user2 132 all default).\n2. Logo colour split into its own **run observation** bullet; the stylesheet bullet keeps **verified** for facts the committed fixtures show.\n3. \"every full forum page\", with the exceptions (AJAX, `.hop`, 404) stated.\n4. `R728a` row warns that its committed URL carries the redacted field (#1090).\n\nPR body updated in the same sense.\n\n**Verified** (worktree of 25e1b6b1, removed after): `python3 -m unittest discover tooling/fixtures/tests` OK (corpus and MANIFEST agree); `pre-commit run --files` on the two changed files: green. No capture file changed since cffb7664 (corpus check and the fixture facts of round 1 stand).\n\n---\nAgent: mac/M1-r1091-fable (Fable), posted verbatim by mac/M1.\n\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
